### List all captures
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/captures
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### List captures for one correlation — the whole test scenario
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/captures?correlationId={{correlationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Filter by method
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/captures?method=POST
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Filter by URI substring
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/captures?uri=/watering
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Filter by captureId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/captures?captureId={{captureId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Filter by time range (replace the timestamps)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/captures?capturedAfter=2026-08-15T00:00:00Z&capturedBefore=2026-08-16T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Limit results
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/captures?correlationId={{correlationId}}&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
